\Delta V = 5 \times 10^6 \mathrm{Pa} \times 70 \times 10^9 \mathrm{Pa}^{-1} = 3.5 \times 10^{16} \mathrm{m}^3
\]

Now, we need to find the change in edge length \(\Delta L\). The volume of a cube is given by:

\[
V = L^3
